    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Filter in the media library for files that are assigned to any post type. The files must be assigned to the pages or posts for the filter to work.</p>\n<p>The development repository is on <a href=\"https://github.com/threadi/media-attached-filter\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload &#8220;media-attached-filter&#8221; to the &#8220;/wp-content/plugins/&#8221; directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added hook for supported post types</li>\n<li>Use only public post types</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/threadi/media-attached-filter/blob/master/changelog.md\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">older changes</a></p>\n"
    },
